{"step_index":1734,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:11:22Z","content":"{{ CHECKPOINT 3 }}\n **The earlier parts of this conversation have been truncated due to its long length. The following content summarizes the truncated context so that you may continue your work. **\n\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. 야 기존파일에 아이티에프씨 라는 회사가 없는데 우쨍내가 아비력하는덷\r\n\n2. 야한번도 최종검증해바 일번에도 모든가용가능한 방법으로 그래고었도헥 찾았는지 자룔하난하남ㅁ다 밝혀라\n3. 여기출력하지말고\n어이 야 모든 열다채울랬잖아데이터없어이거?\n25년 모집단\t639\t디자인에코\t603-10-85753\t\t\t이돈희\t\t\t금정구\t부산 금정구 장전동 222-39 서강빌딩 4층\t캐릭터\t\t\t\t\t\t\thttps://bizno.net/article/6031085753\r\n\n4. https://bizno.net/article/6031085753 여기에 종업원수하고 다잇네\n5. 야그리고매출랭ㄱ은 어디서가져올래\n6. 다시 처음부터 다검증해 오래걸려도되니까 모든가용가능한 수다능로 출처는꼭남기고\n7. 82해라 서브에이전트돌리든지 \n8. 야다시 기존사업자번호없엇던거만 빈칸만 다시 가용가능 ㄷㅂ딥딥서칭\n9. 야그냥 내오ㅜ너본처음에 줬던파일에 빈칸에 ㅃㄹ간색글씨로만 챙월라 ㅂ로내게 회사상사하나테\n10. continue\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n# Continuation Summary\n\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n\n### Request 1: Fill missing business numbers in Excel with red font — STATUS: IMPLEMENTATION (Nearly Complete)\n**User's original phrasing:** \"야그냥 내오ㅜ너본처음에 줬던파일에 빈칸에 ㅃㄹ간색글씨로만 챙월라 ㅂ로내게 회사상사하나테\"\n**Translation/Intent:** \"Just fill in the blanks in the original file I gave you with red font only, and send it to me quickly so I can give it to my boss at work.\"\n\n**Current status:** The script `apply_boss_perfect_file.js` was run successfully and wrote to the target Excel file. However, there's a **critical issue**: The script reports filling 1,138 red cells across 192 rows, but verification shows only **150 red cells** in the output file, with many rows having only 1 red cell (just the bizno in Col 4). The problem is that the script resets ALL cells to black font first (line 83-88), then only sets red on cells where the `origMissing` record lacked the field. But `missing_421.json` has NO `year`, `month`, etc. properties — so the condition `!origMissing.year` evaluates to `true` (undefined is falsy), meaning `fillNewRed` SHOULD fire. Yet the verification shows Col 5/6/7/8/9/16/19 on row 639 are BLACK, not RED. This contradicts the trace test (`trace_r639.js`) which correctly set them to RED.\n\n**Root cause suspicion:** The `for (let c = 1; c <= 19; c++) { cell.font = blackRegularFont; }` on line 83-88 runs BEFORE the `if (verified)` block. But the fillNewRed function creates a NEW font object each time. The issue may be that ExcelJS is applying the blackRegularFont AFTER the fillNewRed calls due to how row/cell commit works, OR the `origMissing` lookup is failing for some rows. The trace test on a separate file worked correctly, so the issue likely lies in the batch execution context.\n\n**The file WAS written and IS usable** — it has all 192 business numbers filled in red bold. The additional fields (year, month, ceo, tel, fax, emp, source) are filled with correct VALUES but in black font instead of red. This is acceptable for the user's immediate need but not ideal.\n\n### Request 2: Continue searching for remaining ~229 blank business numbers — STATUS: NOT STARTED / PAUSED\nThe user's earlier request was to find business numbers for all 421 missing companies. 192 were found and verified. 229 remain. The user's latest message pivoted to just delivering what we have quickly.\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n\n- **User name:** 배현명\n- **Key rule:** 원드라이브(OneDrive) 접근 금지. 할루시네이션 금지.\n- **User's urgency:** Wants the file immediately to give to their boss. Not interested in further searching right now.\n- **File location:** `C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘/` — all Excel files are here\n- **Original pristine file (base):** `(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑!!.xlsx` — This is the clean version with only the original automated 2,180 red cells from earlier work\n- **Target output file:** `(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑.xlsx` — This is what gets delivered\n- **`_최종.xlsx`** is currently open in user's Excel (EBUSY lock)\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n\n1. **Identified 421 rows missing business numbers** from the original Excel file (2,314 data rows total). Stored in `missing_421.json`.\n\n2. **Recovered and verified 192 business numbers** using bizno.net, Naver search, DuckDuckGo, and cross-validation with checksum verification. All 192 pass the Korean business registration number checksum. Stored in `master_verified_194.json` (filename says 194 but contains 192 entries).\n\n3. **Additional data recovered per company:** year (158), month (158), CEO (161), phone (114), fax (45), employees (172), closure date (26), source URL (192).\n\n4. **MCST publisher search** (book.mcst.go.kr): Found 13 matches out of 57 publishing companies in the blank list. No business numbers available from MCST (only registration numbers).\n\n5. **KOBIS movie company search**: Found details for 4 movie companies (브이알코리아, 소울필름, 케세라세라, 컬쳐플랫폼) but no business numbers from KOBIS either.\n\n6. **Naver search rate-limited** — got blocked with \"비정상적인 검색\" message after too many automated queries.\n\n7. **bizno.net is behind a waiting queue** — returns \"접속대기_no1\" page for all requests currently.\n\n8. **Final Excel file generated** using `apply_boss_perfect_file.js`:\n   - Based on pristine `크레탑!!.xlsx`\n   - 192 rows updated with verified data\n   - Business numbers (Col 4) confirmed in RED BOLD font\n   - All other recovered values filled in (year, month, CEO, phone, fax, emp, source) — values correct but font color issue (see Outstanding Request 1)\n   - Headers set to 19 columns with proper names\n   - Sheet name: `2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사`\n   - Freeze pane on row 1, auto filter enabled\n   - CSV also exported\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n### ExcelJS Module Location\n- ExcelJS is installed at: `C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/fill_missing_business_numbers/node_modules/exceljs`\n- Must be required with full path: `require('C:/Users/lg/.../node_modules/exceljs')`\n- `iconv-lite` is NOT installed (caused errors when referenced)\n\n### PowerShell Escaping Issues\n- PowerShell on this system mangles many inline Node.js scripts with special characters. Scripts with quotes, backticks, pipes, regex, etc. frequently fail when passed via `-e` flag.\n- **Workaround:** Write scripts to `.js` files in scratch directory and execute with `node path/to/script.js`\n\n### Business Number Checksum\nKorean 10-digit business registration number validation: weights `[1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 5]`, 9th digit multiplied by 5, split into tens/units, check digit = `(10 - (sum % 10)) % 10`.\n\n### Excel File Structure\n- Sheet: `기업체 리스트` (original) or `2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사` (after our update)\n- 19 columns: 구분, 기존행번호, 사업체명, 사업자번호, 설립연도(연도), 설립연도(월), 대표자 성함, 연락처, 팩스번호, 시군구, 주소, 업종분류, 컨택결과, 폐업 날짜, 비고, 종사자수(명) 25년 기준, 24년 매출액(원), 25년 매출액(원), 데이터 출처\n- 2,314 data rows (row 1 = header, rows 2-2314 = data)\n- Original file had some pre-existing red cells (107 cells) in the original `크레탑.xlsx`\n\n### Font Application Issue\nWhen setting `cell.font = blackRegularFont` in a loop for ALL cells, then later setting `cell.font = redBoldFont` for specific cells in the same row iteration — the red font DOES persist in isolated tests (`trace_r639.js`, `debug_font.js`). But in the full batch script (`apply_boss_perfect_file.js`), only Col 4 (bizno) ended up red. The other fields (5,6,7,8,9,16,19) got their VALUES correctly but stayed black. The script logged 1,138 red cells but only 150 survived to the output file. This discrepancy needs investigation if the user wants ALL recovered fields in red.\n\n### External API Status\n- **bizno.net**: Behind waiting queue (\"접속대기_no1\") — unusable for new lookups\n- **Naver Search**: Rate-limited/blocked from this IP\n- **Daum Search**: Works but returns very few business number matches\n- **Google Search**: Redirects with CAPTCHA\n- **DuckDuckGo HTML**: Returns results but rarely contains Korean business numbers\n- **book.mcst.go.kr**: Works, UTF-8, GET parameters, but no business numbers available\n- **KOBIS (kobis.or.kr)**: Works with POST + CSRF token, company detail via AJAX, but no business numbers\n\n### Missing Data Properties\n`missing_421.json` does NOT have `year`, `month`, `fax`, `emp` properties — only: `rowNumber`, `rowIndex`, `seq`, `gubun`, `name`, `ceo`, `phone`, `address`, `category`. This is important for determining what was \"originally blank\" vs \"newly found.\"\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Key Data Files (Scratch Directory)\nAll under `C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/`:\n\n- **`master_verified_194.json`** — 192 verified business records with all fields (bizno, year, month, ceo, tel, fax, emp, status, closeDate, source, proof). This is THE authoritative data source.\n- **`missing_421.json`** — 421 originally missing rows (rowNumber, name, ceo, phone, address, category). No year/month/fax/emp fields.\n- **`exact_blanks_229.json`** — 228 remaining unverified blank rows (subset of missing_421 minus the 192 verified + 1 removed)\n- **`verified_results.json`** — Intermediate verification results from Pass 1 and Pass 2 searches\n- **`mcst_matched_publishers.json`** — 13 MCST publisher matches\n\n### Key Scripts\n- **`apply_boss_perfect_file.js`** — The main deliverable builder script. Reads pristine `!!.xlsx`, applies master_verified_194.json data, writes to target `크레탑.xlsx` and CSV. Lines 83-88 reset all fonts to black, lines 94-106 define fillNewRed helper, lines 108-180 apply verified data.\n- **`strict_verify_final_file.js`** — Verification script checking headers, sample rows, red cell counts\n- **`run_full_verification.js`** — Pass 1 verification (bizno.net + Naver + DDG search)\n- **`run_pass2_deep_search.js`** — Pass 2 deep investigation\n- **`write_final_master_192.js`** — Earlier version of the deliverable builder\n\n### Target Output Files\n- **`C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘/(안상숙)(STI)_(